{"ID":"20240205153748-ajpf3eh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153748-ajpf3eh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153748-ajpf3eh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113745-h2121rd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614124141-46lpbad\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619183453-yh3d221\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"378补21木通","type":"doc","updated":"20240828160557"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113745-h2121rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113745-h2121rd","updated":"20240705102243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"关木通"}]},{"ID":"20240206113758-yxyivqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113758-yxyivqi","updated":"20240206113805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产华东地区。\n【性状】\t木通：藤茎圆柱形，稍扭曲，直径0.20.5cm。表面灰棕色，有光泽，有浅的纵纹，皮孔圆形或横向长圆形，突起，直径约1mm；有枝。质坚脆，较易折断，横断面较平整，皮部薄易剥离，木部灰白色，导管孔排列紧密而无规则，射线细，不明显，中央髓圆形，明显。气微，味淡而微辛。三叶木通：藤茎圆柱形，扭曲，直径0.21.5cm。表面灰色、灰棕色或暗棕色，颜色不均匀，极粗糙，有许多不规则纵裂纹及横裂纹，有时附生灰绿色苔藓，皮孔圆形或横向长圆形，突起，棕色，不明显，直径12mm；有枝痕。皮部易与木部剥离，去皮处表面棕黄色，射线处有深棕色纵沟。质坚韧，难折断，断面木部黄白色，导管孔细密，排列不规。白木通藤茎直径58mm。表面黄棕色或暗棕色，有不规则纵沟纹；有枝痕。质坚韧，难折断，断面木部淡黄色，导管细密，排列不规则，射线约13条，浅黄色放射状，髓类圆形。气微，味徽苦。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热利尿；活血通脉。主小便赤赤；淋浊；水肿；胸中烦热；喉喉疼痛；口舌生疮；风湿痹痛；乳汁不通；经闭；痛经。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113756-ubin6bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113756-ubin6bg","updated":"20240206113756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113756-8ywdrpc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705102255-qnhlak8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705102255-qnhlak8","updated":"20240705102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240705102255-7m9ta34.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240828151040-zuptxhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828151040-zuptxhk","updated":"20240828151040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 615px;","style":"width: 605px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"关木通4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/关木通4-20240705103204-oqufyd5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 605px;\" parent-style=\"width: 615px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 638px;","style":"width: 628px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"关木通5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/关木通5-20240705103256-wwdeyzq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 628px;\" parent-style=\"width: 638px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828151040-qbans4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828151040-qbans4k","updated":"20240828151040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"关木通2"},{"Type":"Nod