e":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 454px;","style":"width: 444px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"关木通 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/关木通 2-20240828150644-4x14onx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 444px;\" parent-style=\"width: 454px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 813px;","style":"width: 803px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"关木通 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/关木通 9-20240828152628-r0y9jys.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 803px;\" parent-style=\"width: 813px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828150506-qq69jjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828150506-qq69jjg","updated":"20240828150506"}},{"ID":"20240206113438-7p786t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113438-7p786t5","updated":"20240206113440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"川木通"}]},{"ID":"20240206113451-worl6oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113451-worl6oe","updated":"20240206113453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于四川、贵州、湖南、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t呈长圆柱形，略扭曲，长50100cm，直径23.5cm。表面黄棕色或黄褐色，有纵向凹沟及棱线；节处多膨大，有叶痕及侧枝痕。残存皮部易撕裂。质坚硬，不易折断。切片厚0.2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.4cm，边缘不整齐，残存皮部黄棕色，木部浅黄棕色或浅黄色，有黄白色放射状纹理及裂隙，其间布满导管孔，髓部较小，类白色或黄棕色，偶有空腔。\n【性味】\t淡、苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热利尿，通经下乳。用于水肿、淋病，小便不通，关节痹痛，经闭乳少。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113445-g7ouvfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113445-g7ouvfy","updated":"202402061